{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your glamorous new life as <strong>an underpaid intern!</strong> Your mission? Survive the endless flood of emails from your \u201ccoworkers\u201d. Some are legitimate requests. Some are phishing scams. And some are\u2026 well, Sharon from HR asking for your Netflix password again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Sleeping with the Phish</strong>, your inbox <i>is</i> the battlefield. Spot the scams, deny the shady requests, and keep your company (and yourself) from sleeping with the metaphorical fishes. Misjudge one? Oops. Say goodbye to company secrets - and your salary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980190/extras/f0a96eb0aac4e623723a1c4bcfa69875.poster.avif?t=1766143705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980190/extras/f0a96eb0aac4e623723a1c4bcfa69875.webm?t=1766143705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980190/extras/f0a96eb0aac4e623723a1c4bcfa69875.mp4?t=1766143705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What can you expect?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emails with personality</strong> \u2013 From ridiculous requests to suspiciously misspelled &quot;urgent&quot; messages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coworkers you\u2019ll love to hate</strong> \u2013 With <i>glorious</i> headshots that HR should never have approved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust issues simulator</strong> \u2013 Who\u2019s a legit colleague, and who\u2019s a scammer in disguise?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comedy first, cybersecurity second</strong> \u2013 Learn something <i>accidentally</i> while laughing at Jeff in Marketing\u2019s terrible email etiquette.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phishy business</strong> \u2013 Report the bad ones, reply to the good ones, and try not to get roasted on the company dinner party. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980190/extras/23f5e0f49d51d27537d1d33ce4217c0c.poster.avif?t=1766143705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980190/extras/23f5e0f49d51d27537d1d33ce4217c0c.webm?t=1766143705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980190/extras/23f5e0f49d51d27537d1d33ce4217c0c.mp4?t=1766143705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you can survive corporate chaos armed with only your wits, suspicion, and a &quot;Report&quot; button? Or will you be the intern who handed over the CEO\u2019s bank details for a free pizza coupon?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980190?t=1766143705","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980190/9cf7dbce6c450ca28113177546ed07d9611eb0d8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766143705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980190/20d3016a39992051ad2735e2fa012e71dc44c5d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766143705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980190/20d3016a39992051ad2735e2fa012e71dc44c5d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766143705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":7